<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian currency reserves up 0.3 pct in Nov.</title>
<headline>Austrian currency reserves up 0.3 pct in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian foreign currency reserves rose 0.3 percent to 193.1 billion schillings in October, the National Bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    AUSTRIAN CURRENCY RESERVES	 Nov 96    Oct 96</p>
<p>    Reserves (bln ATS)		   193.104   192.505</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 53112 274</p>
